oq-2 evidence (fix round 1): the configuration-B sweep, verbatim.

Produced by the committed docs/spikes/mutation-ratchet/run-oq2.sh, not by
a stub and not by hand. Command, in a throwaway local clone of the scratch
worktree detached at e963f4d0 (never in a worktree):

  $ OPERATORS=all ONLY_PKGS="internal/store internal/readinessload internal/journey" \
      bash run-oq2.sh /tmp/fix-mr /tmp/fix-mr-bin/gremlins
  exit status: 0

ONLY_PKGS restricts the sweep to the three packages that have real
mutant-level data; the other seven touched packages are covered in the
README's oq-2 section (two are unmeasurable by this tool, five were not
reached). Unreduced output follows.

